# Line coverage the engine must not fall below, in percent.
#
# A ratchet, not a target. Chasing a number produces tests written for the
# metric; what this guards is narrower and worth more -- that a change cannot
# quietly arrive with less of it covered than what is already there. The V4
# port shipped whole subsystems with no call site and no test, and nothing said
# so.
#
# Raise it when a run comes in comfortably above: `cargo llvm-cov` prints the
# figure, and moving this line is the whole of it. Never lower it without
# saying why in the commit message.
